<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Southern Calif. Power agency.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Southern Calif. Power agency.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Friday it has limited capacity for Southern California Public Power Authority transmission revenue bonds rated Aa3/A.</p>
<p>Capacity is available on a first-come, first-served basis and is initially limited to $20 million per firm.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-MBIA-NOW.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
